    title: "partial-install warnings never find a linker's requirement row: LINKER_LANGUAGE_REQUIREMENTS is keyed jni / swift_objc / dependency but diagnostics carry registered names (jni-linker ...), so package suggestions and the WI-ruman relevance gate never run"  # 530e
